Targets route lessons to exactly one surface. The composed render carries only the `{playbook}`
lesson; the `--step` fetch carries only the `{playbook}/{step}` lesson, appended to the bare body
under its own step-worded `## Lessons` section. Both invocations run over one fixture and their
stdout concatenates below.

-- fixtures/home/Claude/_lessons/0001_alpha.md --
---
title: Alpha rule
targets: [fx-lesson-route]
---

Alpha body.
-- fixtures/home/Claude/_lessons/0002_step.md --
---
title: Step rule
targets: [fx-lesson-route/s1]
---

Step-scoped body.
-- fixtures/home/Claude/_playbooks/fx-lesson-route/playbook.md --
---
name: fx-lesson-route
title: Lesson Route
summary: Playbook and step targets on one playbook.
---

Preamble.
-- fixtures/home/Claude/_playbooks/fx-lesson-route/playbook.yaml --
graph:
  s1: []
-- fixtures/home/Claude/_playbooks/fx-lesson-route/s1/prompt.md --
---
name: s1
summary: Only step.
detached: sonnet:medium
---

Step body.
-- cmd --
booping render-playbook fx-lesson-route
booping render-playbook fx-lesson-route --step s1
-- exit --
0
